## Technical Constraints

- **Do not install a full component library** (shadcn/ui CLI, Chakra, MUI). Build the primitives by hand — they can follow shadcn/ui patterns but must be self-contained files.
- **All color values must go through CSS custom properties** — no hardcoded hex/rgb in component files.
- **Every component must accept and merge a `className` prop** using the `cn()` utility.
- **No `"use client"` unless the component genuinely needs client-side interactivity** (theme toggle, mobile menu). Keep everything else as server components.
- **Framer Motion** is used only for the mobile menu animation in this subproject. Don't add page transitions yet (that's Subproject 8).
- **Imports must use path aliases** (`@/components/...`, `@/lib/...`).

